# Portfolio project

This workspace is a personal website (Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind). Do not add Homebridge, LeetCode practice, or a language-learning app here.

- Write copy that matches work that actually exists on GitHub or in production.
- Keep the site small: home, selected projects, about/contact.
- Use the App Router under `src/app`. Prefer server components unless the UI needs client state.
- After layout or interaction changes, verify the flow in the browser.
